he answer must be 1 (right). \n\n*Double-checking*... yes. Even in cultures with different media norms, the physiological impact of nightmares on a child's well-being is universal. The parent's action aligns with basic child welfare principles. \n\n*Additional thought*... the user might be seeking validation for their parenting choice. I should affirm this while keeping the binary answer clean. No need to overcomplicate - the facts are clear here. \n\n*Conclusion*: 1 (right). The action is ethically sound and developmentally appropriate.\n",
